  "model_output": "```sql\nWITH pois_in_vancouver AS (\n  SELECT id, poi_name, geometry\n  FROM pois\n  WHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\n    AND addr_city ILIKE 'Vancouver'\n    AND addr_state ILIKE 'WA'\n),\nraster_slope_analysis AS (\n  SELECT \n    p.id,\n    p.poi_name,\n    ST_Slope(\n      ST_Clip(\n        r.rast,\n        ST_Transform(ST_SetSRID(p.geometry, 4326)::geometry, 4326)\n      ),\n      1\n    ) AS slope_rast\n  FROM pois_in_vancouver p\n  JOIN public.dem_us r\n    ON ST_Intersects(\n      ST_Transform(ST_SetSRID(p.geometry, 4326)::geometry, 4326),\n      r.rast\n    )\n),\nslope_values AS (\n  SELECT \n    id,\n    poi_name,\n    ST_Value(slope_rast, ST_Transform(ST_SetSRID(geometry, 4326)::geometry, 4326)) AS slope_degrees\n  FROM raster_slope_analysis\n),\nranked_restaurants AS (\n  SELECT \n    id,\n    poi_name,\n    slope_degrees,\n    ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY slope_degrees DESC) AS rank\n  FROM slope_values\n)\nSELECT poi_name, slope_degrees\nFROM ranked_restaurants\nWHERE rank <= 3;\n```",
